# terraform.tfvars.example — igmf/connectivity

Deploy values for **uksouth** live in:

[`../../region/uksouth/igmf.connectivity.tfvars`](../../region/uksouth/igmf.connectivity.tfvars)

AzDo IGMF pipelines: prefer the region var-file (loaded automatically when present).
If `seedIgmfTfvars` still copies this example into the stack dir, keep it as a pointer only —
or point seed at the region file in a later change.

```bash
terraform plan \
  -var-file=../../region/uksouth/igmf.connectivity.tfvars \
  -var=location=uksouth
```
